{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/factorykit\/injectedobservable"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FactoryKit\/documentation\/FactoryKit\/InjectedObservable","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A property wrapper that injects an Observable dependency into a SwiftUI view."}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"InjectedObservable"}],"title":"InjectedObservable","roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:10FactoryKit18InjectedObservableV","modules":[{"name":"FactoryKit"}],"symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"InjectedObservable"}],"platforms":[{"name":"iOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"17.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"iPadOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"17.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"Mac Catalyst","beta":false,"introducedAt":"17.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"macOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"14.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"name":"tvOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"17.0","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"name":"watchOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"10.0"}]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FactoryKit\/documentation\/FactoryKit\/InjectedObservable\/init(_:)-5387n","doc:\/\/FactoryKit\/documentation\/FactoryKit\/InjectedObservable\/init(_:)-8hen6","doc:\/\/FactoryKit\/documentation\/FactoryKit\/InjectedObservable\/init(_:)-zktg"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FactoryKit\/documentation\/FactoryKit\/InjectedObservable\/projectedValue","doc:\/\/FactoryKit\/documentation\/FactoryKit\/InjectedObservable\/wrappedValue"],"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FactoryKit\/documentation\/FactoryKit\/InjectedObservable\/DynamicProperty-Implementations"],"generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@propertyWrapper"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"InjectedObservable"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"text":"T","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Observable","preciseIdentifier":"s:11Observation10ObservableP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/FactoryKit\/documentation\/FactoryKit\/Scenes"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"InjectedObservable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is designed to automatically resolve and inject Observable dependencies","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"from a shared container, allowing for easy management of Observable objects within"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI views. This property wrapper ensures that the dependency is resolved on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first use and provides state storage, direct access, and binding capabilities."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"And unlike using State (prior to iOS 27), the injected dependency is only resolved once, on first use.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To use ","type":"text"},{"code":"InjectedObservable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" just add the view model dependency to a Factory container.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Define the dependency","extension Container {","    @MainActor var sceneDemoViewModel: Factory<SceneDemoViewModel> {","        self { SceneDemoViewModel() }","    }","}","\/\/ And use the property wrapper in the View to obtain the view model.","struct SceneDemoView: View {","    @InjectedObservable(\\.sceneDemoViewModel) var model","    var body: some View {","        Text(model.text)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"InjectedObservable"},{"type":"text","text":" can also look for a registered scene container and use that container instead of Container.shared. This can be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"beneficial in multitasking environments like SplitView."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To do so, register and store the container at the scene root, NOT the app root."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["@main","struct DemoApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            PerSceneContentView()","        }","    }","}","\/\/ Create a new container for each scene.","struct PerSceneContentView: View {","    @State var sceneContainer = Container()","    var body: some View {","        ContentView()","            .environment(\\.container, sceneContainer)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You’ll probably also want to pass the container into the view model on initialization so it’s accessing the proper dependencies. Using"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Injected"},{"type":"text","text":" or other Factory property wrappers will revert to accessing "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Container.shared"},{"type":"text","text":", which is not what we want."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["extension Container {","    @MainActor var sceneDemoViewModel: Factory<SceneDemoViewModel> {","        self { SceneDemoViewModel(container: self) }","    }","}","","@MainActor","@Observable","final class SceneDemoViewModel {","    private let service: MyServiceType","    init(container: Container) {","        \/\/ If you want the service resolved from the \"per scene\" container do this!","        self.service = container.myServiceType()","    }","    \/\/ Not this!","    @Injected(\\.myServiceType) private var badDependency","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This property wrapper is available on iOS 17.0, macOS 14.0, tvOS 17.0, and watchOS 10.0.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"Requires","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The wrapped type ","type":"text"},{"code":"T","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" must conform to the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Observable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" protocol.","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FactoryKit\/documentation\/FactoryKit"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/FactoryKit\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/FactoryKit\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/FactoryKit\/7SwiftUI15DynamicPropertyP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"references":{"doc://FactoryKit/documentation/FactoryKit/InjectedObservable/projectedValue":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"projectedValue"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI7BindingV","text":"Binding"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10FactoryKit18InjectedObservableV1Txmfp","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"title":"projectedValue","identifier":"doc:\/\/FactoryKit\/documentation\/FactoryKit\/InjectedObservable\/projectedValue","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Provides a binding to the 